  "question": {
    "text": "A rectangular loop has a sliding connector PQ of length $\\ell$ and resistance $\\mathrm{R} \\Omega$ and it is moving with a speed $v$ as shown. The set-up is placed in a uniform magnetic field going into the plane of the paper. The three currents $I_1, I_2$ and $I$ are \n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bo-z63pX7OcPU9GNwHolUu62C_DPCEpRD3rYMWGQOqk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Rvu4l",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{I}_1=-\\mathrm{I}_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{B} \\ell \\mathrm{v}}{\\mathrm{R}}, \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~B} \\ell \\mathrm{v}}{\\mathrm{R}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Bzi5B",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{I}_1=\\mathrm{I}_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{B} \\ell \\mathrm{v}}{3 \\mathrm{R}}, \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~B} \\ell \\mathrm{v}}{3 \\mathrm{R}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "q0FiD",
      "text": "\n$l_1=I_2=I=\\frac{B \\ell v}{R}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Xg5w9",
      "text": "\n$I_1=I_2=\\frac{B \\ell v}{6 R}, I=\\frac{B \\ell v}{3 R}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "A moving conductor is equivalent to a battery of emf $=\\mathrm{v} \\mathrm{B} \\ell \\quad$ (motion emf)\nEquivalent circuit\n$$\n\\mathrm{I}=\\mathrm{l}_1+\\mathrm{l}_2\n$$\napplying Kirchoff's law\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{I}_1 R+I R-v B \\ell=0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{I}_2 R+I R-v B \\ell=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nadding (1) \\& (2)\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 2 \\mathrm{IR}+\\mathrm{IR}=2 \\mathrm{vB} \\ell \\\\\n& \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{vB} \\ell}{3 \\mathrm{R}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{I}_1=\\mathrm{I}_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{vB} \\ell}{3 \\mathrm{R}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/pUPjsjy75K1skV7dpyzQKQNVetAfCge7PX6GHTWQouE.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
